{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARNITHA: PATIENT 66</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexplained murder, you are asked to enter the house of a man who killed his wife and daughter. A simple favor to retrieve a document... turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house shifts. Doors seal shut. Voices whisper in the dark. Each room reveals memories that aren't your own. Notes, symbols, and disturbing apparitions uncover the story of <strong>Patient 66</strong> \u2014 a man who survived horrific experiments, but was never the same again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape, or descend deeper into madness?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A story where reality twists, time shifts, and memories deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Multiple Environments</strong> \u2013 Explore a haunted house, a rotting cellar, and the infamous Parnitha Sanatorium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd26 Survival Tools</strong> \u2013 Use flashlights and glowsticks to light your way through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Exploration</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors and secrets by finding codes and hidden numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Unfolding Narrative</strong> \u2013 Discover notes, symbols, and apparitions that connect you to Patient 66.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Whispers, cries, and haunting ambience that pull you deeper into fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2696\ufe0f Escape or Succumb</strong> \u2013 Every step brings you closer to freedom... or to the rebirth of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"Night Has Fallen\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/c4f6b797a2931077b1eeca434f853308f9d4f64c.jpg"},{"name":"\"Welcome to the Cellar\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/a6ac7fd57c88e6994eb64c36468225b7cf7fc543.jpg"},{"name":"\"Underground Parnitha Found\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/1f82e0c200b6248ee4d9ae407e1667ddec220f59.jpg"},{"name":"\"Old Parnitha\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/9fda4ecde6e5de49937fdaa7447667e985d77150.jpg"},{"name":"\"All Keys Collected\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/3a13b94d07873d2f8051c1a09408541381fad139.jpg"},{"name":"\"All Notes Collected\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/fae4511aa31fcf3f47ee468be91e6b50fb91ce10.jpg"},{"name":"\"All Tools Collected\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4056910/0a4cc1419118ca9d507eeb241562dc5745650243.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056910?t=1764926132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056910/50520480eb0c60006e0b26adc64b0f378f1eee3a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764926132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056910/461859f7258a742a0c49ba599fc5386efc2b1498/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764926132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056910/461859f7258a742a0c49ba599fc5386efc2b1498/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764926132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains horror themes, disturbing imagery, and graphic content such as blood and exposed flesh. While it does not focus on extreme gore or splatter, players will encounter unsettling environments, violent situations, and depictions of human remains."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARNITHA: PATIENT 66</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexplained murder, you are asked to enter the house of a man who killed his wife and daughter. A simple favor to retrieve a document... turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house shifts. Doors seal shut. Voices whisper in the dark. Each room reveals memories that aren't your own. Notes, symbols, and disturbing apparitions uncover the story of <strong>Patient 66</strong> \u2014 a man who survived horrific experiments, but was never the same again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape, or descend deeper into madness?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A story where reality twists, time shifts, and memories deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Multiple Environments</strong> \u2013 Explore a haunted house, a rotting cellar, and the infamous Parnitha Sanatorium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd26 Survival Tools</strong> \u2013 Use flashlights and glowsticks to light your way through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Exploration</strong> \u2013 Unlock doors and secrets by finding codes and hidden numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Unfolding Narrative</strong> \u2013 Discover notes, symbols, and apparitions that connect you to Patient 66.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Whispers, cries, and haunting ambience that pull you deeper into fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro